      "Id": "0D7jR0000005M9ZSAU",
      "FeedItemId": "0D5jR000000gd6ySAA",
      "CommentBody": "<p>OK, please hold off on this. This appears to be a formula field on the contact, relating back to whatever the Persona is on the account level. So, changing this isn&#39;t going to help anything right now. I am assuming the Account level is overwriting anything we&#39;re doing on the website end. Is this correct? If so, are we able to make the customer_persona on the Contact Object a picklist field that matches the Account level? The personas should all attach to an individual contact/prospect and not an entire account.</p>",
